\b Privacy\b0\par
\par
In its default Rules Only mode, AS Resume Sorter processes documents entirely on this computer and sends nothing over the network. If you choose to enable an external AI provider in Settings, extracted page text is sent to that provider; the application states this clearly before you enable it.\par
